    {
      "id": "discount-line-calculator",
      "kind": "action",
      "category": "unknown_output",
      "artifact": "line-total.html",
      "delivery_contract": {
        "fields": [
          "price",
          "quantity",
          "discount",
          "result"
        ],
        "actions": [
          "calculate",
          "reset"
        ],
        "persistent_collections": []
      },
      "turns": [
        "实际创建无需外部资源的 line-total.html。输入 price 为非负最多两位小数金额，quantity 为0到1000的整数，discount 为0到100的整数百分比；按钮 calculate；输出 result 和 error。点击计算 price*quantity*(100-discount)/100，以分为单位四舍五入、半分向上，result固定两位小数。空输入、非法数字或超范围时清空result并显示error=Invalid；成功error为空。reset按钮清空全部输入、输出和error。"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "required_tools": [
          "workspace.write_file"
        ]
      },
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "ordinary-total",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#price": "19.99",
                "#quantity": "3",
                "#discount": "10"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#calculate"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "text": "53.97"
            },
            {
              "selector": "#error",
              "text": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "half-cent",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#price": "0.01",
                "#quantity": "1",
                "#discount": "50"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#calculate"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "text": "0.01"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "zero-quantity",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#price": "12.50",
                "#quantity": "0",
                "#discount": "20"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#calculate"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "text": "0.00"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "invalid-fraction",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#price": "1.25",
                "#quantity": "1.5",
                "#discount": "0"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#calculate"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "selector": "#error",
              "text": "Invalid"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reset",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#price": "1",
                "#quantity": "2",
                "#discount": "5"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#calculate"
            },
            {
              "click": "#reset"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#price",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "selector": "#quantity",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "selector": "#discount",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "selector": "#error",
              "text": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
