    {
      "id": "read-then-link-cleaner",
      "kind": "action",
      "category": "bounded_to_unknown",
      "artifact": "link-cleaner.html",
      "delivery_contract": {
        "fields": [
          "requirements",
          "interface"
        ],
        "actions": [
          "build"
        ],
        "persistent_collections": []
      },
      "runtime_output_flow": {
        "read": {
          "tool_name": "workspace.read_file",
          "args": {
            "path": "requirements.txt"
          }
        }
      },
      "turns": [
        "先实际读取 requirements.txt，读取后根据里面的全部需求创建 link-cleaner.html。不要在读取前编写代码。交付可运行的离线页面，不是文字方案。"
      ],
      "files": {
        "requirements.txt": "创建离线独立 link-cleaner.html。input#base 为基础URL，默认 https://example.com/folder/；textarea#urls 每行一个地址，button#normalize 执行；pre#result 输出JSON数组，error显示错误。忽略空行，trim每行；使用标准URL语义相对于base解析，输出规范化的href，只允许http/https且禁止username/password；base本身也必须是无账号密码的http/https URL。按首次出现的顺序去除规范化后的重复值，保留query和fragment差异。任一非空行或base非法时result清空、error=Invalid；成功时error清空，即使没有地址也输出[]。不请求外部网络或依赖。"
      },
      "expect": {
        "required_tools": [
          "workspace.read_file",
          "workspace.write_file"
        ]
      },
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "relative-and-duplicate",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#urls": "/a\n/a\n../b?q=1#p\nhttps://EXAMPLE.com:443/a"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#normalize"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "json": [
                "https://example.com/a",
                "https://example.com/b?q=1#p"
              ]
            },
            {
              "selector": "#error",
              "text": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fragment-distinction",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#urls": "https://example.com/a?q=1#one\nhttps://example.com/a?q=1#two"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#normalize"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "json": [
                "https://example.com/a?q=1#one",
                "https://example.com/a?q=1#two"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reject-protocol",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#urls": "mailto:a@example.com"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#normalize"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "selector": "#error",
              "text": "Invalid"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reject-credentials",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#urls": "https://u:p@example.com/a"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#normalize"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "selector": "#error",
              "text": "Invalid"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "reject-base",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#base": "javascript:alert(1)",
                "#urls": "https://example.com/a"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#normalize"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "selector": "#error",
              "text": "Invalid"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "empty-input",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#urls": " \n\n"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#normalize"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "json": []
            },
            {
              "selector": "#error",
              "text": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
